We're excited to lead doxxnet's Series A.

AI has made it dramatically easier to collect information about people, and agents acting on our behalf expand the surface area we need to protect.

@DoxxnetHQ gives people and their agents a parallel, private network they can build on: browse privately, transfer files directly, connect devices and agents into encrypted meshes, and communicate peer to peer.

@BarrettLyon helped pioneer the modern DDoS defense industry with Prolexic, and has spent more than two decades building networks and defending them against attackers.

Welcome Barrett Lyon and the doxxnet team!

By @YODELAGARZA and @martin_casado
